    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93684" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμίδᾱλις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span></span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span> in <i><span class="en">
			Archestr.
			<u>Fr.</u>
			4.14
		</span></i>), ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the finest wheaten flour</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.42
			</span></i>, <i>Acut.(Sp.)</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				412
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				63.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				2
			</span></i> (who has gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιδος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				18.6
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Apoc.</u>
				18.13
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμιδάρεως</span> is an
			error in <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				736.82
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>:—hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμῐδᾱλίτης</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ]
				ἄρτος, ὁ</span>, <i>bread made of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμίδαλις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				2.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				3p.179
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.Siph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.115c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Trypho
			</span></i> ib. <i><span class="en">
				109c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.Med.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				1.2.2
			</span></i>, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεμιδάλιν</span></b>  ( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιον</span>
			), τό, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				2.190.45
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>, <u>Gloss.</u> (Cf. Assyr.
				<i>samīdu</i>, Aram.
			<i>semīdā</i> in same sense.)</div>
